  "paragraphs_sample": [
    {
      "index": 5,
      "style": "Heading 8",
      "text": "Certificate issue"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Two certificates are included in the price for every certification and every recertification. The agreement in the offer is binding."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Additional costs for additional certificates (if applicable): __________________________________"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Please enclose a translation in all desired languages of the scope of certification. (Else we must charge you for the translation)"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "For extra information and explanations please use an additional sheet. The client must be informed that it is only possible to deliver the certificates after the certification contract is signed."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "style": "Heading 8",
      "text": "Sub certificates: (optional)"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Sub certificates for the following sites including complete address and the scope of the certification for every site (the scope of certification of a sub certificate can be the same as in the main ce"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The certification body of TÜV AUSTRIA GMBH certifies in accordance with TÜV AUSTRIA procedures that the company (Note: Please state name, address, zip code and place) 1)"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "for the scope 2)"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "applies a management system in line with the standard."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "It has been proven that the requirements of the standard"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "are met."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "style": "footnote text",
      "text": "1) When specifying the certified company, the company name registered under commercial law, address, zip code and town must be stated. If only part of a company is included in the certification system"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "style": "footnote text",
      "text": "2) The scope must reflect the activities (sales, trade, development, manufacturing, assembly, service, etc.) as well as the products or services. It must be suitable to clearly identify, without furth"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "style": "Heading 8",
      "text": "Statement of applicability (SoA) only required for certifications according to ISO 27001"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "style": "Heading 8",
      "text": "Operator number (BNetzA) only required for certifications according to IT-SiKat"
    }
  ],
